# The marimba: a bar's partials at 1, 4 and 10 times the fundamental,
# struck and dying fast, the upper partials first. dacvoice remakes
# ../lib/marimba.voice from it.
name marimba
family percussion
n 12
harmonics 1 1.0  4 0.35  10 0.08
bright 1.5
timbres 0 10 20
start 30 dB
attack 0.002 s
peak 0 dB
decay 40 dB/s
sustain none
release 0.03 s
